  unitName: Administrator Sera
  unitId: 20684
  unitNumber: 1456
  description: A mock Unit based on Sera Starride of the Akras Summoners' Hall. She
    is aware of the latest management data through her use of all kinds of information
    technology, and always maintains her cool while acting as a guide to Summoners.
    It is said that because of this, even Summoners who have little contact with
    her have immense faith in her meticulous work. She is also said to be fully trusted
    by the upper ranks of the Summoners' Hall on account of her extremely serious
    personality and how she can always be expected to prioritize the rules before
    all else.
  summonDesc: Excuse me.<br>But would you...<br>Would you please summon Bran along
    with me next time?
  fusionDesc: Thank you very much.<br>I have to perform up to the expectations you
    hold for me...
  evoDesc: I see...<br>This is a much stranger sensation than the rumors had lead
    me to believe.
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
